2026-11-16: PrismArc contributors began this fork from Arcify 5.2.0
(e565122217c2c106faa6dccdc4f8ced3ec5b423c). Fork changes include local
extension storage, restricted runtime permissions and communication, and
tab and history search through Quick Switcher.

2026-11-17 through 2026-11-18: The fork expanded tab and bookmark
organization, added a recent-tab picker and optional Google Calendar
preview, and updated onboarding and the PrismArc interface.

2026-11-19: The fork revised session recovery, archive and bookmark
handling, and packaged extension build and release verification.

2026-11-20: The fork unified optional in-page placement for its switchers,
retained native window fallback and history-deletion confirmation, and
redesigned the Space options menu, Settings page, and first-run guide.

2026-11-21: PrismArc 5.3.0 adds Undo for Clean, nonadjacent tab selection,
app-wide appearance settings and Space gradients, and a new getting-started
guide. It also improves the layout and webpage overlays of both switchers.

Original source: https://github.com/nisargkolhe/arcify
PrismArc source snapshots: https://github.com/eladmoshe/prismarc-public

The element capture feature adapts DivPic by Matan Orland (rainDelay9).
